<title>ALGERIA: Port conditions update - Algeria - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Algeria - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions -- Algeria</p>
<p>Algiers, Dec 30 - During the last two weeks, 10 to 12 vessels reported at anchorage awaiting berths. Average time on roads about two to three days.</p>
</text>
